// Production_Stage form workflow.
// Record Event: Edited -> Form Event: Before form submission -> Load of the form.
//
// Greys the name out when an existing stage is opened, so nobody types a new
// one and only finds out at Submit. validateProductionStage is the real guard -
// it refuses the rename however the record is changed; this only saves the
// round trip. Why a name is fixed once saved: see that file.
//
// Bare field name for a client task, no "input.".

disable Stage_Name;
